# Records are inputs, tracked by name rather than by directory. Each record
# is scanned for address shapes, key shapes and the compute provider's name,
# and for the vocabulary leak scan, before it is committed: git history is
# permanent, so the scan that matters is the one before the commit. A new
# record is a decision; it must not inherit one from this file.

# LaTeX build products.
main.pdf
*.aux
*.log
*.out
